From 8f0e60c3355efc127a2ae973c1e607e2778c4dcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Hristov Yanev <icyhoty2k@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 12:25:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refactor: each ThumbnailPanelWnd owns its own D3D swap chain
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each panel (CacheWnd, DirWnd, SpawnedDirWnd) now manages its own DXGI
swap chain and D2D device context as member variables. The shared
RendererD2D is only borrowed for:
  1. One-time device acquisition (GetD3DDevice/GetD2DDevice) during Init
  2. Shared cache lookups (ResolveThumbnailBitmaps) at render time

This means any number of DirWnd/SpawnedDirWnd instances can coexist with
no coupling to each other or to the main viewer renderer.

RendererD2D.h:
- Remove ThumbnailPanelType enum (Cache/Dir/Spawned0/1/2) entirely
- Remove ThumbnailPanel struct and all panel member vars
- Remove CreatePanelDeviceResources/RenderPanel/ResizePanel/
  DiscardPanelDeviceResources/GetPanelContext/GetPanel
- Add GetD3DDevice(), GetD2DDevice() device accessors
- Add ResolvedThumb struct + ResolveThumbnailBitmaps() for lock-safe
  cache lookup shared by all panels
- RequestDirThumbnail now takes HWND hPanel (caller passes its own HWND)

RendererD2D.cpp:
- Remove the above five panel management methods
- Add ResolveThumbnailBitmaps (lock-under-mutex bitmap resolution for
  both m_dirThumbCache and m_bitmapCache)
- RequestDirThumbnail: hPanel parameter replaces GetPanel(Dir).hwnd

ThumbnailPanelWnd.h:
- Add per-instance panel resources: m_swapChain, m_panelContext,
  m_panelBackBuffer, m_placeholderBrush, m_borderBrush, m_hoverBrush
- Remove GetPanelType() virtual (no longer needed)
- Add UsesDirThumbCache() virtual (false=CacheWnd, true=DirWnd variants)
- CreateDeviceResources/ResizeSwapChain/Render now work on owned members

ThumbnailPanelWnd.cpp:
- Rewrite CreateDeviceResources: borrows d3d/d2d device once, creates
  swap chain + device context + brushes as owned members
- Rewrite ResizeSwapChain: operates on m_swapChain/m_panelContext
- Rewrite Render: calls ResolveThumbnailBitmaps then draws on m_panelContext

DirWnd.h:
- Remove GetPanelType() override, SetSlotIndex(), m_slotIndex from
  SpawnedDirWnd — no longer needed
- Add UsesDirThumbCache() = true override to DirWnd

DirWnd.cpp:
- RequestDirThumbnail now passes m_hWnd as hPanel

CacheWnd.h:
- Remove GetPanelType() override

UIManager.cpp:
- Remove SetSlotIndex() call
